WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Keep the original. Retain the issued record. Do not silently replace it.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Link the correction. Record what changed and link the earlier version.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Reconcile the payment. Keep money already received connected to the invoice.
